    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update python-apache-tvm-ffi to 0.1.13.post2.

- post2 keeps object optionals pointer-sized
- post1 marks type-info lookup as pure, makes ModuleObj stable, adds Rust
  structural_visit/structural_walk, and keeps the source patch version ahead of
  post releases

Verified locally on aarch64/openSUSE_Tumbleweed: build green, rpmlint 0 errors
0 badness (the 6 potential-bashisms warnings are in the bundled libbacktrace and
are unchanged from the previous revision), spec-cleaner diff empty,
source_validator clean.</comment>
